# Real golden dataset is user-provided and not committed.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!chat.sample.jsonl
# ranking.sample.jsonl is the opposite: a committed regression suite, not
# user-provided data. Its measured output (ranking.out.tsv) stays ignored.
!ranking.sample.jsonl
# au_phrases.txt is the same kind of thing and was excluded by oversight: the
# README documents it as "the AU accuracy set", but being untracked it existed
# on exactly one laptop, so every accuracy run over it was unreproducible by
# anyone else and no CI test could depend on it. It holds curated food phrases
# chosen to cover shapes that have actually broken -- no user data.
!au_phrases.txt
